The adjacent patch is a source-only proposal. It removes one full detached plan materialization per successful source-error invocation; its dynamic contribution and benefit are unknown. Root should require actual original/candidate native equality, getter/error/alias controls and an unchanged bounded oneBox measurement before selecting it. There is no speed/FPS claim, full-route gate or engineering-request closure.
